As we collected more than 2800 + 1000 signatures right now, we thought it would be great to give the fans a chance at <b>designing the DVD covers</b>. All the designs will be published on <a href="http://www.madonnavillage.it" targte=_blank>http://www.MadonnaVillage.it</a> - <b>Drowned Madonna's Community</b> - and you will be able to vote for your favourites. 
