    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>The following cuttings are from yesterday's daily newspapers <STRONG>"La Prensa"</STRONG> and <STRONG>"Dia a Dia"</STRONG>. The first one talks about the <STRONG>Vogue photoshoot</STRONG> and <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s new passions for hourses and hunting. The second one&nbsp;is about <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> plans for a <STRONG>customs exhibition</STRONG>.</P>
<P align=center><IMG src="/images/2005/panama/laprensa21lug.jpg" align=middle border=0>&nbsp;<IMG src="/images/2005/panama/DiaADia21lug.jpg" align=middle border=0></P><img src="/corrispondenti/co-enrique_panama.jpg" border="0">
</font></div>
